# Troublemaker Ouphe {1}{G} (2/2): "Bargain. When this creature enters, if it was bargained, exile target artifact or enchantment an
# opponent controls." Bot2 controls three Moxen and a Ghostly Prison, all legal targets (CR 115.2); Bot1's own Moxen are not, nor
# is the Ouphe. Bot1 casts it on turn 3 sacrificing Mox Jet (bargain, CR 702.166a) and exiles Bot2's Mox Ruby: exiled, not
# destroyed (nothing goes to the graveyard), and the Prison and other Moxen stay.

